        "name": "USN-8198-1",
        "description": "It was discovered that Tornado incorrectly handled parsing of large multipart request bodies. An attacker could possibly use this issue to cause a denial of service. (CVE-2026-31958)  It was discovered that Tornado did not properly validate characters in cookie values. An attacker could possibly use this issue to inject arbitrary cookie attributes. (CVE-2026-35536)",
